        <mxCell id="step-1-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;공유&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;휴대폰에서 쇼츠·릴스·아티클 링크나 영상 파일을 텔레그램 봇에 보낸다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-1-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="step-2-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="600" x="0" y="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="2" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Webhook 수신&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;Telegram이 Lambda Function URL로 POST한다. secret_token과 chat_id를 확인하고 바로 200을 돌려준 뒤, 자기 자신을 비동기(InvocationType=Event)로 다시 호출해 처리한다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-2-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="step-3-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="600" x="0" y="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="3" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;설정 로드&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;콜드 스타트 때 Parameter Store의 /event-scraper/* SecureString을 한 번 읽어 캐시한다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-3-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="step-4-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="600" x="0" y="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="4" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;영상 분석&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;YouTube 링크와 업로드 영상은 Gemini 2.5 Flash가 직접 본다. 무료 티어 하루 20회.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-4-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="step-5-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="600" x="0" y="370" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="5" vertex="1" parent="step-5-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;글 요약 · 링크 검색&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;아티클과 텍스트는 Claude Haiku 5.5가 web_fetch·web_search로 읽는다. 언급된 도구의 공식 링크는 검색 결과에 실제로 나온 URL만 남긴다. Gemini가 막히면 YouTube도 Claude가 제목·설명을 바탕으로 대신 요약한다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-5-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="step-6-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="600" x="0" y="500" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="6" vertex="1" parent="step-6-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notion 기록&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;콘텐츠 아카이브 DB에 행을 만들고 요약·핵심·해볼 것·링크·원문 본문을 채운다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-6-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

