          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;답장&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;한 줄 요약과 Notion 페이지 링크를 텔레그램으로 돌려준다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-7-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="step-8-legend" connectable="0" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="600" x="0" y="670" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-8-badge-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="8" vertex="1" parent="step-8-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-8-desc-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;일일 배치&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;EventBridge rate(1 day)가 Lambda를 깨워, 아직 비어 있는 행(웹 클리퍼로 넣은 것 등)을 같은 경로로 채운다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1" parent="step-8-legend">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="legend-aux-note" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;fontStyle=2;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;Auxiliary Services(단계 번호 없음): CloudWatch Logs는 실행 로그, IAM 실행 역할은 SSM 읽기와 self-invoke 권한만 가진다.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1" parent="legend-container">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="600" x="0" y="790" as="geometry" />
